  "description": "<p class=\"p1\"><strong><span class=\"s1\">&bull; Brand Introduction:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">Shirayuki International offers authentic Japanese kitchen cloths crafted with tradition, quality, and care. Our products bring the timeless beauty of Japanese design into daily life, combining elegance, functionality, and eco-consciousness.</span><span class=\"s3\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong><span class=\"s1\">&bull; Product Description:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">Our collection features Shirayuki kitchen cloths, tea towels, and hand towels, known for their exceptional softness, absorbency, and durability. Made using traditional Japanese weaving techniques, they are lightweight, quick-drying, and perfect for daily use in the kitchen or home. Stylish yet practical, they also make thoughtful gifts.</span><span class=\"s3\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong><span class=\"s1\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</span></strong><span class=\"s3\"></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Authentic Japanese craftsmanship</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Eco-friendly, reusable, and sustainable</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Lightweight, highly absorbent, and fast-drying</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Beautiful designs blending tradition and modern living</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Ideal for home use, gifting, and lifestyle-conscious customers</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong><span class=\"s1\">&bull; Payment Terms:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">10% commission per sale.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">Payments are made monthly via PayPal.</span><span class=\"s3\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong><span class=\"s1\">&bull; Other Information:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">We offer worldwide shipping and are expanding globally to bring traditional Japanese quality to customers everywhere. Our products are appreciated by those who value sustainability, thoughtful design, and everyday beauty. Affiliates targeting lifestyle, eco-conscious, kitchenware, and gifting audiences perform especially well.</span><span class=\"s3\"></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"s2\">Join us in sharing a piece of Japan with the world!</span></p>",
